{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X 在 S11 把“即使对方不需要他仍愿意陪伴”改成了“彼此需要”，人物动机出现偏移；另外部分段落的感受描写容易挤占心理叙事的注意力。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边扫的普通观众，X 的重点加亮让我能迅速抓住每段人物心理的变化，感受又按音乐实际进程出现，不必同时处理一大堆短词。它把水波、摇荡、失重、漂浮到最终停定等意象串成了连续体验，音乐和人物情绪也更容易联系起来，细节尤其具体。Y 的心理解释有时更完整、更稳妥，但整体更像一段人物故事旁边配了一组感受词，音乐与文字的同步感和细腻程度不如 X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "73355548-a442-43d2-bc5d-3b1cbbd0fbee", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T172638603640Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.281, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T17:27:47.896059+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ff714d169363ec4800aabb7b0c58a01ba0babe1e52df2e7fc36f06fb35ffcd78", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgp